</mrow></math><div class="formula-string">,</div></div><h5 class="label">(1)</h5></div>where
                  <div class="def-list"><a class="usa-link" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9"><!-- named anchor --></a><div class="def-list table"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin-bottom: 2em;"><dl><dt class="def-term cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9aa"><p><i>N</i><sub>MMI7</sub></p></dt><dd class="def-def cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9ab2"><p class="" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9ab2b1" style="margin-block-end: -1em;">is the expected number of instances of MMI 7 or greater ground motion,</p></dd><dt class="def-term cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9b1a"><p><i>M</i><sub>main</sub></p></dt><dd class="def-def cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9b1b2"><p class="" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9b1b2b1" style="margin-block-end: -1em;">is the mainshock magnitude,</p></dd><dt class="def-term cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9b2a"><p><i>t</i><sub>0</sub></p></dt><dd class="def-def cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9b2b2"><p class="" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9b2b2b1" style="margin-block-end: -1em;">is the candidate wait time,</p></dd><dt class="def-term cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9b3a"><p><i>t</i><sub>e</sub></p></dt><dd class="def-def cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9b3b2"><p class="" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9b3b2b1" style="margin-block-end: -1em;">is the planned duration of time inside a damaged building,</p></dd><dt class="def-term cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9b4a"><p><i>M</i><sub>aft</sub></p></dt><dd class="def-def cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9b4b2"><p class="" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9b4b2b1" style="margin-block-end: -1em;">is the aftershock magnitude,</p></dd><dt class="def-term cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9b5a"><p><b><i>M</i></b></p></dt><dd class="def-def cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9b5b2"><p class="" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b3b5b9b5b2b1" style="margin-block-end: -1em;">is the set of magnitudes <span class="inline-formula"><math id="ofr20261029-m2" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xmlns:ali="http://www.niso.org/schemas/ali/1.0/" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
