</div>The expected number can then be converted to probability:
                  <div class="disp-formula panel"><a class="usa-link" id="ofr20261029-e02"><!-- named anchor --></a><div class="formula-content"><math id="ofr20261029-m3" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xmlns:ali="http://www.niso.org/schemas/ali/1.0/" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
