</tr>
</tbody>
<caption style="display: none;">Table 2.    Wait time (rounded to the nearest day) until probability of Modified Mercalli Intensity
                        (MMI) 7 or greater shaking from aftershocks is at or below 0.4 percent during the
                        entry period, for subduction zone mainshocks.</caption></table></div>
</div>
<p id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b5c11">The median and 84th percentile aftershock probabilities <i>P</i><sub>forecast</sub> corresponding to a 0.4 percent probability of MMI 7 or greater shaking at a single
                  location are shown in <a class="usa-link" href="#ofr20261029-t03">table 3</a> for continental mainshocks. We use the forecast for a reference magnitude of <i>M</i><sub>forecast</sub>=5. Instead of waiting a prescribed time, as in <a class="usa-link" href="#ofr20261029-t01">table 1</a>, a user can wait until the forecast probability is at or below the level in <a class="usa-link" href="#ofr20261029-t03">table 3</a>. The threshold <i>P</i><sub>forecast</sub> probabilities increase for larger magnitude mainshocks, because larger mainshocks
                  affect a larger area, so it is less likely that any one <i>M</i>≥<i>M</i><sub>forecast</sub> aftershock would be felt at a given location. Because the probabilities do not depend
                  on the aftershock productivity, the probabilities for active continental and stable
                  continental regions are similar.</p>
<div class="table-wrap panel" style="display: float; clear: both"><a class="usa-link" id="ofr20261029-t03"><!-- named anchor --></a>
<div><h3 style="display:inline;font-size: 1em;">Table 3.    </h3>Threshold probability of a magnitude [<i>M</i>]≥5 aftershock within the next day, for crustal mainshocks. Waiting until the forecast
                        probability is at or below this threshold achieves a 0.4 percent or lower probability
                        of Modified Mercalli Intensity (MMI) 7 or greater shaking from aftershocks during
                        the next day.</div><sup class="caption" style="font-size: 85%;top: 0.5em;">
<h4 aria-hidden="true" class="subsection-title"></h4>
<p id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b7b1b1b5c13b1b3" style="display:inline;">[%, percent]</p>

