<caption style="display: none;">Table 3.    Threshold probability of a magnitude [M]≥5 aftershock within the next day, for crustal mainshocks. Waiting until the forecast
                        probability is at or below this threshold achieves a 0.4 percent or lower probability
                        of Modified Mercalli Intensity (MMI) 7 or greater shaking from aftershocks during
