            manuscript. Any use of trade, firm, or product names is for descriptive purposes only
            and does not imply endorsement by the U.S. Government.</p>
</div><div class="section ref-list" outline="toc"><a class="toc_anchor usa-link" id="ofr20261029-toc_anchor_8" style="position: relative;"></a><a class="usa-link" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b9b3"><!-- named anchor --></a><h2 class="publication-title">References Cited</h2>
