<div class="def-list"><a class="usa-link" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2"><!-- named anchor --></a><div class="def-list table"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin-bottom: 2em;"><dl><dt class="def-term cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2aa"><p>GMM</p></dt><dd class="def-def cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2ab2"><p class="" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2ab2b1" style="margin-block-end: -1em;">Ground Motion Model</p></dd><dt class="def-term cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b1a"><p><i>M</i></p></dt><dd class="def-def cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b1b2"><p class="" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b1b2b1" style="margin-block-end: -1em;">magnitude</p></dd><dt class="def-term cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b2a"><p><i>M</i><sub>W</sub></p></dt><dd class="def-def cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b2b2"><p class="" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b2b2b1" style="margin-block-end: -1em;">moment magnitude</p></dd><dt class="def-term cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b3a"><p>MMI</p></dt><dd class="def-def cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b3b2"><p class="" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b3b2b1" style="margin-block-end: -1em;">Modified Mercalli Intensity</p></dd><dt class="def-term cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b4a"><p>NGA</p></dt><dd class="def-def cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b4b2"><p class="" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b4b2b1" style="margin-block-end: -1em;">Next Generation Attenuation</p></dd><dt class="def-term cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b5a"><p>PGV</p></dt><dd class="def-def cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b5b2"><p class="" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b5b2b1" style="margin-block-end: -1em;">Peak Ground Velocity</p></dd><dt class="def-term cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b6a"><p>USGS</p></dt><dd class="def-def cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b6b2"><p class="" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b6b2b1" style="margin-block-end: -1em;">U.S. Geological Survey</p></dd><dt class="def-term cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b7a"><p><i>V</i><sub>s30</sub></p></dt><dd class="def-def cell" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b7b2"><p class="" id="ofr20261029-w56ab1b5b3b2b7b2b1" style="margin-block-end: -1em;">time-averaged shear-wave velocity to a depth of 30 meters</p></dd></dl></div></div>
